        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Ice</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>LandIce</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>glacial landform</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>glacier feature</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>envoPolar</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:comment>Ambiguities in notion of feature and overly general equivalence axiom was making incorrect assertions. For example popsicle would reason under this class.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>Likely to be depopulated and &quot;glacial&quot; made into a quality or similar.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>obsolete glacial feature</rdfs:label>
        <owl:deprecated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</owl:deprecated>
    </owl:Class>
