        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03605014"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Karsts usually form in masses of carbonate rock such as limestone or dolomite. Karst landscapes display distinctive surface features and underground drainages, and in some examples there may be little or no surface drainage.</rdfs:comment>
