        <owl:annotatedTarget>An extensive flat plain of glacial till that forms when a sheet of ice becomes detached from the main body of a glacier and melts in place depositing the sediments it carried.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Till_plain</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


