        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000106"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An area of land of low topographic relief that historically supported grasses and herbs, with few trees, and having generally a mesic (moderate or temperate) climate. Dominated by tall grasses (contrast steppe).</obo:IAO_0000115>
