            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An extent or area of land where surface water from rain and melting snow or ice converges to a single point at lower elevation, usually the exit of the basin, where the waters join another waterbody.</obo:IAO_0000115>
