        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>meteorite crater</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>meteorite impact crater</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>meteoroid impact crater</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
