                    </owl:Restriction>
                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </owl:equivalentClass>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fan-shaped deposit formed where a fast flowing stream flattens, slows, and spreads typically at the exit of a canyon onto a flatter plain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EcoLexicon:alluvial_fan</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
