        <oboInOwl:inSubset>envoPolar</oboInOwl:inSubset>
        <rdfs:comment>This biome includes open-ocean and unprotected coastal ecosystems, characterized by exposure to wave action, tidal fluctuation, and ocean currents as well as systems that largely resemble these. Water in the marine biome is generally within the salinity range of seawater: 30 to 38 ppt.</rdfs:comment>
