        <obo:IAO_0000115>The liquid produced when water percolates through any permeable material. It can contain either dissolved or suspended material, or usually both.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leachate</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>ENVO</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
