        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A cosmetic product which has been formulated 2) to have a viscous, fatty, liquid consistency resembling the fat-rich component of milk and 2) to be applied to human facial skin to modify its appearance or functioning.</obo:IAO_0000115>
