        <owl:annotatedTarget>A habitat that is in or on a living insect. Here &quot;insect&quot; denotes an individual of a species that is a sub-taxon of NCBITaxon:50557.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165"/>
