        <obo:IAO_0000115>Lime mudstone is a limestone which is primarily composed of either clay-size or both silt-size and clay-size detrital (transported) carbonate grains.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>ORCID:0000-0002-4366-3088</oboInOwl:created_by>
