        <owl:annotatedTarget>A flush toilet fixture into which water is manually poured to dispose of excreta.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toilet</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
