        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mineral material composed primarily of sodium chloride.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>This class is for material primarily composed of sodium chloride. For other pure chemical salts, consider a CHEBI class. Request new ENVO terms for environmental samples of other chemical salts.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>salt</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset>envoPolar</oboInOwl:inSubset>
