            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A layer of estuarine water which extends from the surface of the water column to the pycnocline or mid-depth and from the shore to a fiat boundary where the estuary bed below the water column reaches a depth of 4 meters.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>&quot;Mid-depth&quot;, present in many CMECS classes, is ambiguous and needs refinement.</obo:IAO_0000116>
