                        </owl:unionOf>
                    </owl:Class>
                </owl:someValuesFrom>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mussel bed which is located in benthic regions beyond (offshore to) a continental shelf.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>If individual mussels are  present in densities sufficient to construct biogenic substrate, please use the mussel reef class.</obo:IAO_0000116>
