        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000668"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fault across which older rocks are pushed above (away from the core of an astronomical body) younger rocks.</obo:IAO_0000115>
