        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">This is a legacy term, formerly in the manufactured product hierarchy under &quot;paper product&quot;. A &quot;letter paper&quot; term is now present where this term once was. ENVO is not the right ontology for the generically dependent continuant class, but will host it for now.</obo:IAO_0000116>
