Uses undesirability standard, compared to polluted river&apos;s ecological impact standard. What is the relation to ENVO:00002114 &apos;chemically enriched sediment&apos;? Does &apos;element&apos; in the definition refer to something found in the periosic table (like selenium) or the member of some set, aka an entity?</obo:IAO_0000116>
