        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>brown coal</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>It is considered the lowest rank of coal due to its relatively low heat content. It has a carbon content around 60–70 percent.</rdfs:comment>
